cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CodeQAPass or its frozen evaluation records, please cite it as below."
title: "CodeQAPass: A Bilingual Evidence-Grounded System for Python Codebase Understanding"
type: software
abstract: >-
  CodeQAPass (Code Question Answering over Retrieved Passages) is a local-first system for understanding
  Python repositories through Persian or English questions. It combines deterministic code analysis, lexical
  and semantic retrieval, grounded answer generation, function documentation, and verified navigation to the
  exact source file, symbol, and line range. File paths, symbols, source hashes, and line ranges come from
  canonical SQLite metadata, never from model-generated text.
